---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const title = 'Cookie Policy | Betapixel';
const description = 'How Betapixel Studios LTD uses essential, analytics and marketing cookies on betapixels.studio, how consent works and how to change your cookie preferences.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Cookie Policy', path: '/cookie-policy/' }]}>
  <article class="section--tight">
    <div class="wrap article prose legal">
      <h1 class="h1-body">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="article-meta">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-09-24">24 September 2026</time></p>
      <p>This Cookie Policy explains how Betapixel Studios LTD uses cookies and similar technologies when you visit our website, betapixels.studio.</p>
      <p>It should be read together with our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website.</p>
      <p>They help websites function correctly, remember certain preferences, understand how visitors use the website, and improve the browsing experience.</p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
      <p>Betapixel Studios LTD may use cookies to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep our website functioning correctly</li><li>Remember your preferences</li><li>Understand how visitors interact with our website</li><li>Measure website traffic and performance</li>
        <li>Improve website content and navigation</li><li>Support forms, enquiries, shopping, or ordering features</li><li>Measure the performance of advertising or marketing campaigns where these services are used</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Types of Cookies We May Use</h2>
      <h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
      <p>These cookies support functions necessary for the website to operate.</p>
      <p>They may be used for security, forms, shopping features, sessions, or other core website functions.</p>
      <p>Because these cookies are necessary for the website to work, they may operate without optional cookie consent where permitted by applicable law.</p>
      <h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
      <p>Analytics cookies help us understand how visitors use our website.</p>
      <p>They may provide information such as which pages are visited, how visitors reached our website, and how visitors interact with different pages.</p>
      <p>We may use analytics services to collect this information.</p>
      <h3>Functional Cookies</h3>
      <p>These cookies help the website remember choices or preferences you make.</p>
      <p>They may be used to provide a more consistent experience when you return to the website.</p>
      <h3>Marketing Cookies</h3>
      <p>Where applicable, marketing cookies may help us measure advertising campaigns or show advertising that is more relevant to visitors.</p>
      <p>These cookies may be placed by Betapixel Studios LTD or third-party advertising and marketing services.</p>
      <p>Optional marketing cookies will be handled according to applicable consent requirements.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
      <p>Some website features may involve services provided by third parties.</p>
      <p>These may include:</p>
      <ul><li>Website analytics services</li><li>Embedded maps</li><li>Social media platforms</li><li>Video platforms</li><li>Payment services</li><li>Advertising platforms</li><li>Website security services</li></ul>
      <p>These providers may place or access cookies according to their own privacy and cookie policies.</p>

      <h2>5. Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2>
      <p>Where our website provides a cookie consent tool, you can use it to accept, reject, or manage optional cookies. <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-cookie-open style="min-height:40px;margin-top:8px">Open cookie settings</button></p>
      <p>You can also control cookies through your web browser.</p>
      <p>Most browsers allow you to:</p>
      <ul><li>View stored cookies</li><li>Delete cookies</li><li>Block certain cookies</li><li>Block third-party cookies</li><li>Prevent websites from storing cookies</li></ul>
      <p>Blocking essential cookies may cause some parts of the website to stop working correctly.</p>

      <h2>6. Cookie Consent</h2>
      <p>Where consent is required, optional cookies will only be used according to the choices you make through our cookie consent system.</p>
      <p>You can change your cookie preferences where the website provides this option.</p>

      <h2>7. How Long Cookies Remain</h2>
      <p>Some cookies are temporary and disappear when you close your browser.</p>
      <p>Other cookies may remain on your device for a defined period or until you delete them.</p>
      <p>The duration depends on the purpose and type of cookie.</p>

      <h2>8. Changes to This Cookie Policy</h2>
      <p>Betapixel Studios LTD may update this Cookie Policy when our website, technology, third-party services, or legal requirements change.</p>
      <p>The latest version will be published on our website with its most recent update date.</p>

      <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For questions about this Cookie Policy or how Betapixel Studios LTD handles your information, contact:</p>
      <p>Betapixel Studios LTD<br />Nairobi, Kenya<br />Website: betapixels.studio<br />Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
      <p>You may also contact us using the contact information provided on our website.</p>

      <h2>Appendix: Cookies and Storage Used on This Website</h2>
      <p>For transparency, this is what betapixels.studio currently stores on your device:</p>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Category</th><th scope="col">Purpose</th><th scope="col">Duration</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">bp-consent</th><td>Essential</td><td>Remembers your cookie choices.</td><td>12 months</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">bp-pl, bp-pt, bp-scroll:*</th><td>Essential (session storage)</td><td>Shows the opening animation once per visit, smooths page transitions and restores scroll position on “back”.</td><td>Until you close the tab</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">bp-quote-v1</th><td>Functional (local storage)</td><td>Keeps an unfinished quote request on your device so you do not lose it. Files are never saved; cleared when you submit.</td><td>Until submitted or cleared</td></tr>
          {site.vercelAnalytics && <tr><th scope="row">Vercel Web Analytics</th><td>Analytics (cookieless)</td><td>Counts page views and visits in aggregate so we can see which pages are useful. It sets no cookies and stores nothing on your device; visits are not linked to you across days or websites.</td><td>Nothing stored</td></tr>}
          <tr><th scope="row">_ga, _ga_*</th><td>Analytics (Google Analytics)</td><td>Anonymous statistics about pages and devices. Loaded only if you accept analytics cookies.</td><td>Up to 2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Google Maps</th><td>Third party</td><td>Google may set cookies when you click “Load Google Map” on the contact page. Nothing loads from Google until you click.</td><td>Set by Google</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
      <p>We do not currently use marketing or advertising cookies. If that changes, they will only be set with your consent.</p>
      <p class="small">© 2026 Betapixel Studios LTD. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
